.TH "TESTING12" "1" "" "testing12" "testing 12 Manual"
.SH "NAME"
testing12 \- command line interface for the testing 12 REST API
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B testing12
[\fIglobal options\fR] \fIcommand\fR [\fIsubcommand\fR] [\fIarguments\fR] [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
testing12 calls the testing 12 REST API from the command line. Commands are grouped by resource, and every command prints its result to standard output in the configured format.
.PP
The Scalar Galaxy is an example OpenAPI document to test OpenAPI tools and libraries. It's a fictional universe with fictional planets and fictional data. Get all the data for all planets.
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-base\-url\fR \fI<url>\fR
Override the base URL for API requests.
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<ms>\fR
Request timeout in milliseconds.
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-retries\fR \fI<count>\fR
Number of retries for retryable failures.
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<format>\fR
Output format: auto, json, jsonl, pretty, raw, toon, yaml.
.TP
\fB\-\-format\-error\fR \fI<format>\fR
Error output format: auto, json, jsonl, pretty, raw, toon, yaml.
.TP
\fB\-\-transform\fR \fI<path>\fR
Dot\-path transform for data output.
.TP
\fB\-\-transform\-error\fR \fI<path>\fR
Dot\-path transform for error output.
.TP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-raw\-output\fR
Print transformed string values without JSON quotes.
.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable SDK debug logging on standard error.
.TP
\fB\-\-bearer\-auth\fR \fI<value>\fR
JWT Bearer token authentication. Can also be set with the BEARER_AUTH environment variable.
.TP
\fB\-\-basic\-auth\-username\fR \fI<value>\fR
Basic HTTP authentication. Can also be set with the BASIC_AUTH_USERNAME environment variable.
.TP
\fB\-\-basic\-auth\-password\fR \fI<value>\fR
Basic HTTP authentication. Can also be set with the BASIC_AUTH_PASSWORD environment variable.
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-key\-header\fR \fI<value>\fR
API key request header. Can also be set with the API_KEY_HEADER environment variable.
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-key\-cookie\fR \fI<value>\fR
API key browser cookie. Can also be set with the API_KEY_COOKIE environment variable.
.TP
\fB\-\-o\-auth2\fR \fI<value>\fR
OAuth 2.0 authentication. Can also be set with the O_AUTH2 environment variable.
.TP
\fB\-\-open\-id\-connect\fR \fI<value>\fR
OpenID Connect Authentication. Can also be set with the OPEN_ID_CONNECT environment variable.
.TP
\fB\-\-api\-key\-query\fR \fI<value>\fR
API key query parameter. Can also be set with the SCALAR_69_T4_L_API_KEY_QUERY environment variable.
.SH "COMMANDS"
.TP
\fBtesting12 planets list\fR
Get all planets. See testing12\-planets\-list(1).
.TP
\fBtesting12 planets create\fR
Create a planet. See testing12\-planets\-create(1).
.TP
\fBtesting12 planets retrieve\fR
Get a planet. See testing12\-planets\-retrieve(1).
.TP
\fBtesting12 planets update\fR
Update a planet. See testing12\-planets\-update(1).
.TP
\fBtesting12 planets delete\fR
Delete a planet. See testing12\-planets\-delete(1).
.TP
\fBtesting12 planets upload\-image\fR
Upload an image to a planet. See testing12\-planets\-upload\-image(1).
.TP
\fBtesting12 celestial\-bodies create\fR
Create a celestial body. See testing12\-celestial\-bodies\-create(1).
.TP
\fBtesting12 authentication create\-user\fR
Create a user. See testing12\-authentication\-create\-user(1).
.TP
\fBtesting12 authentication create\-token\fR
Get a token. See testing12\-authentication\-create\-token(1).
.TP
\fBtesting12 authentication list\-me\fR
Get authenticated user. See testing12\-authentication\-list\-me(1).
.TP
\fBtesting12 completion\fR
Print a shell completion script. See testing12\-completion(1).
.SH "SHELL COMPLETION"
testing12 completion <shell> prints a completion script for bash, zsh, and fish. Load it from your shell startup file:
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
eval "$(testing12 completion bash)"
eval "$(testing12 completion zsh)"
testing12 completion fish | source
.fi
.RE
